{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34308","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倩人医病树，看仆补衡茅。\n散髪还同阮，无心敢慕巢。\n简便书露竹，尊待破霜匏。\n日好林间坐，烟萝近欲交。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}